2:T456,{"@context":"https:\u002F\u002Fschema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.artisan.co\u002Fblog\u002Foutbound-sales-playbook#article","headline":"The ultimate outbound sales playbook: How to master proactive prospecting","name":"The ultimate outbound sales playbook: How to master proactive prospecting","description":"The outbound sales game is getting tougher, but fear not. This outbound sales playbook teaches you all you need to know to increase leads and boost conversions.","image":["https:\u002F\u002Fimages.ctfassets.net\u002Fkyprwggh4muz\u002F3ElxA0HQJK0uwlgRf1sMLG\u002Ff24ffc463d4755d2937c627a3cc030ae\u002FArtboard_15.webp"],"datePublished":"2023-12-07","dateModified":"2023-12-07","author":[{"@type":"Person","@id":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.artisan.co\u002Fauthors\u002Fjaspar-carmichael-jack#person","name":"Jaspar Carmichael-Jack","url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.artisan.co\u002Fauthors\u002Fjaspar-carmichael-jack"}],"publisher":{"@id":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.artisan.co\u002F#organization"},"mainEntityOfPage":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.artisan.co\u002Fblog\u002Foutbound-sales-playbook"}4:T42f,Most sales tools automate tasks. Ava owns the entire BDR job. She finds best-fit leads from a database of over 250 million B2B professionals across over 200 countries, plus Artisan Local Data with over 250 million local businesses, using intent signals like funding rounds, leadership hires, and website visits, then enriches them with verified emails and AI web research. She runs personalized campaigns across email and social outreach, continuously testing dozens of message variations and shifting volume toward what converts. Calling is built into the platform too: Ava auto-triggers call steps on engagement and dials them, then a rep takes the live conversation. She handles every reply against a knowledge base and books qualified meetings directly on reps' calendars. Ava Inbound extends the same platform to your website: live chat that greets and qualifies visitors, answers from the same knowledge base, and books meetings with CRM-owner routing, so inbound and outbound run on the same platform. Inbound and outbound both run on the same usage-based pricing.0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","script",null,{"id":"article-json-ld","type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],["$","script",null,{"id":"breadcrumb-json-ld","type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fwww.artisan.co\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Blog\",\"item\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fwww.artisan.co\\u002Fblog\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"The ultimate outbound sales playbook: How to master proactive prospecting\",\"item\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fwww.artisan.co\\u002Fblog\\u002Foutbound-sales-playbook\"}]}"}}],["$","$L3",null,{"post":{"id":"55eyOk4rcjF5VALwMUFv4r","slug":"outbound-sales-playbook","title":"The ultimate outbound sales playbook: How to master proactive prospecting","publishedDate":"2023-12-07","seoDescription":"The outbound sales game is getting tougher, but fear not. This outbound sales playbook teaches you all you need to know to increase leads and boost conversions.","readTime":"12 min","tag":"Sales","heroImage":{"url":"https://images.ctfassets.net/kyprwggh4muz/3ElxA0HQJK0uwlgRf1sMLG/f24ffc463d4755d2937c627a3cc030ae/Artboard_15.webp","width":2475,"height":1160,"title":"The Ultimate Outbound Sales Playbook- How to Master Proactive Prospecting"},"content":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The outbound sales landscape has changed a lot in recent years. With content marketing, social media marketing, blogging, and video dominating, you might think old-school outbound techniques are obsolete by now.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"But donâ€™t be fooled â€“ outbound is still going strong. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"In fact, ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://spotio.com/blog/sales-statistics/#outboundsales"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"75% of executives","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" state that theyâ€™d be willing to make an appointment or attend an event based on a single cold call or email, showcasing just how effective outbound can be.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"If conducted properly, ","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"that is. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"But enough about other companies â€“ letâ€™s talk about your business. How are your outbound efforts stacking up? Are you seeing the results you want? If not, youâ€™ve come to the right place for a tune-up.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Today, weâ€™ll explore how outbound creates opportunities instead of just waiting for inbound leads. Iâ€™ll share not only how to make outbound work for you but how to master the entire process from A to Z.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"So, buckle up and get ready to become an outbound sales pro. With the right strategy and execution, you can transform outbound from outdated to cutting-edge. Letâ€™s stop wondering and start dominating!","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-2","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"An Introduction to Outbound Sales","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"embedded-asset-block","data":{"target":{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"kyprwggh4muz"}},"id":"4YUhg6rjsxZgr6LQxqCtyZ","type":"Asset","createdAt":"2024-05-31T07:16:50.283Z","updatedAt":"2024-08-06T21:05:48.035Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":5,"revision":2,"locale":"en-US"},"fields":{"title":"21","description":"A graphic of a magnet and a graphic of a megaphone with the text \"vs\" in-between them. ","file":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/kyprwggh4muz/4YUhg6rjsxZgr6LQxqCtyZ/8f8a6dfb707521da91b6aa3a39be877a/21.jpeg","details":{"size":72862,"image":{"width":1600,"height":692}},"fileName":"21.jpeg","contentType":"image/jpeg"}}}},"content":[]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.artisan.co/blog/outbound-sales-strategy"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Outbound sales","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" are the opposite of the â€œbuild it, and they will comeâ€ mindset.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Instead, youâ€™re putting on those walking shoes, grabbing your Rolodex, and hitting the pavement to hunt down leads that are best suited for your business.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"While both inbound and outbound sales aim to bring in customers and make sales, outbound sales offer a unique advantage compared with the inbound process.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"One word: ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"control","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":".","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"With outbound sales, you steer the ship and chart your own course. Instead of passively relying on leads finding you, you actively seek them out on your terms. And the more time and resources you dedicate, the more prospects youâ€™ll uncover. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Whatâ€™s more, outbound gives you total control to build your pipeline precisely how you want, focusing on the targets and leads you to deem most promising.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"No more waiting and hoping â€“ just good old-fashioned hustle.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"These are just a handful of the many advantages outbound sales offers. If you want to grab the reins and take charge of your pipeline, outbound is the way to go!","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Whatâ€™s the Difference Between Outbound and Inbound Sales?","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"With ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.artisan.co/blog/inbound-lead-nurturing"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"inbound sales","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":", you take a more passive approach. Like casting a wide net and seeing what fish swim into it, you create content, optimize for search, and run campaigns hoping to attract leads.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"If someone reaches out (or you hook them) after seeing your stuff, thatâ€™s inbound working its magic!","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Outbound sales are the opposite â€“ think door-to-door salesperson vs. bait shop owner.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Instead of waiting around, you grab your tackle box and actively head out into the world to hunt for leads. This requires research to find potential customers, ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.artisan.co/blog/cold-email-to-potential-client"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"crafting personalized messages,","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" and reaching out through email, social media, calls, etc.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"While inbound and outbound sales effectively have a similar goal, inbound marketing is sitting back with a Mai Tai, hoping the fish bite. Outbound is putting on waders, grabbing a net, and scooping up fish whether theyâ€™re biting or not.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Remember, there is no inbound vs outbound sales war. Both are valid strategies with pros and cons! One is reactive, one proactive. Choose the approach that fits your sales style and business goals.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The Problem With Modern Outbound Sales","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Letâ€™s address the elephant in the room â€“ many businesses are struggling with outbound sales. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"According to ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.hubspot.com/marketing-statistics?"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"a 2022 Hubspot report","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":", only 16% of marketers say outbound practices lead to quality leads. Ineffective outbound sales strategies prove this, with","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.zendesk.co.uk/blog/sales-statistics/"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":" over half of outbound marketers","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" admitting their approaches just arenâ€™t working.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"There are plenty of fingers pointing at issues like:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Poor communication between teams","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Not having enough info to properly engage prospects","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Skyrocketing customer expectations","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"\nThe bottom line? Despite time and money invested in outbound, results are stagnant, draining, and unproductive. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"However, the problem is not that outbound sales are inherently bad practice so much as a lack of clear strategy. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The core issue is simple: many companies see outbound as a numbers game focused on quantity over quality. But genuine connection is so critical!","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Think about how often you open your inbox to find it crammed with messages from companies you donâ€™t care about. Annoying, right?","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Businesses are churning out content and outreach, but it falls flat because itâ€™s so impersonal. And with more subpar digital tools automating everything, sales teams blast generic pitches to thousands with little success.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The result? Prospects feel overwhelmed by impersonal outreach, so response rates drop, giving outbound a bad reputation.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"For outbound to really soar, your outbound sales approach needs an overhaul.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-2","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The Benefits of an Effective Outbound Sales Strategy ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Executed correctly, outbound sales are one of the most powerful strategies for keeping your pipeline full and closing deals. They let you directly contact potential customers and have meaningful conversations.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Effective outbound also enables you to:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Build relationships with prospects before they even realize they need you","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Control the narrative and spotlight your unique value proposition","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Stand out from competitors by offering personalized solutions for pain points","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Save time and resources by targeting only qualified, bullseye outbound leads","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"\nWhen done right, outbound lets you engage leads on your terms and steer them through the buyerâ€™s journey. Itâ€™s like having a blueprint to build strong relationships and promote your solutions.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Outbound sales can be effective when done right, and statistics back this up. Companies that donâ€™t cold call ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://about.crunchbase.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/Cold_Calling_Tips_Sale_Reps-V4.pdf?hubs_content=blog.hubspot.com%252Fsales%252Fsales-statistics&hubs_content-cta=Sales%2520Prospecting%2520Statistics"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"experience 42% less growth","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" than those who do. ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.rainsalestraining.com/blog/b2b-sales-funnel-stages"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"71% of buyers","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" are open to talking to sellers when theyâ€™re actively looking for new solutions. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"A stellar outbound ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.artisan.co/blog/lead-generation-vs-lead-nurturing"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"sales strategy","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" executed flawlessly can be an absolute game-changer for driving deals. Turn cold calling into warm conversations, and watch your pipeline heat up!","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-2","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"What Does a Successful Outbound Sales Process Look Like? Six Key Steps","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"embedded-asset-block","data":{"target":{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"kyprwggh4muz"}},"id":"3RstkYKb1ZTseCbHaHhEVH","type":"Asset","createdAt":"2024-05-31T07:16:50.280Z","updatedAt":"2024-08-06T21:06:52.397Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":9,"revision":2,"locale":"en-US"},"fields":{"title":"22","description":"An infographic explaining the steps of a successful outbound sales process: Research your audience, Create a lead database, Tailor outreach messages, Undertake calls & meetings, Seal the deal, Refine your sales process. ","file":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/kyprwggh4muz/3RstkYKb1ZTseCbHaHhEVH/2033fb8f72b8a9d391e2a73cafdad937/22.png","details":{"size":464786,"image":{"width":836,"height":1600}},"fileName":"22.png","contentType":"image/png"}}}},"content":[]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"While the approach varies from business to business, a generally successful outbound sales process will look like this:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Step #1 â€“ Research and Identify Your Target Audience","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Before reaching out, itâ€™s crucial to fully understand your ideal customer. Effective selling means grasping their desires and needs. The more intel you gather, the better you can customize your outreach.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"This approach hugely benefits your sales reps, especially when dealing with diverse clients or a wide range of products/services.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Utilize data-driven research tools to pinpoint companies or people matching your target audience profile.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Market segmentation is key here, and youâ€™ll need to ask critical questions like:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Who is your target audience?","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"What types of businesses are you aiming to sell to?","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Who are the decision-makers in these companies?","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Have you built a detailed buyer persona?","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"\nWithout comprehensive answers, your team may lack the vital details to connect with the right folks. In fact, ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://spotio.com/blog/sales-statistics/"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"42% of sales reps","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" feel they donâ€™t have enough information about prospects prior to making calls. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Do your homework and get crystal clear on your ideal customer. This level of insight takes your outbound efforts from generic to tailored, and youâ€™ll know exactly how to resonate with each prospect and guide them to your solutions.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"This is highly targeted outreach at its finest.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"blockquote","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Tools like ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.artisan.co/request-demo"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Artisan AIâ€™s Sales Reps","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" can help speed up this process. Ava, Artisanâ€™s AI sales rep, comes with over 265 million built-in leads to help you create a targeted list of potential contacts. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Step #2 â€“ Creating a Lead Database","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Alright, youâ€™ve identified your dream customers. Now itâ€™s time to gather their deets to connect with them. The best way is an organized lead database.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"We know, databases sound boring. But having all your prospects in one searchable place is crucial for your sales reps. Theyâ€™ll have everything needed to target the right folks and crush it.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Weâ€™re talking essential info like:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Email addresses","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Phone numbers","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Social media profiles (primarily LinkedIn)","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Company name and website","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Job title and department","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Pain points they may have","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Other useful personal details (birthdays, preferences, etc)","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"\nAnd hereâ€™s a pro tip â€“ treat your database like a garden, not a chore. Nurture it! Add new leads, update info, and weed out outdated contacts. This keeps your prospect list fresh and fertile for sales success.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Having this organized and up-to-date resource makes targeting and outreach way easier. You can filter leads by location, company, role, and more to create perfect outreach lists.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"So embrace the database! It may not be sexy, but itâ€™ll help you get results and forge great relationships.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Step #3 â€“ Tailoring Your Outreach Messages","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"When it comes to outreach, personalization is key to unlocking those lead connections. ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.forbes.com/sites/blakemorgan/2020/02/18/50-stats-showing-the-power-of-personalization/?sh=3c1bfab42a94"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"According to ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"Forbes","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":", ","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"91% of customers are more likely to shop with brands that provide personalized recommendations and 80% of customers are more likely to make a purchase from brands that provide personalized experiences. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Every client and customer has different problems and goals. If you tap into those and show how you can make their life easier, youâ€™ve got a winning lead on your hands!","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Now we know what youâ€™re thinking â€“ personalizing every message would take forever. Sales reps already send so many emails; how can they customize each one?","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Hereâ€™s the good news â€“ itâ€™s not as hard as it sounds with the right approach.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"First, research each lead â€“ their company, role, objectives, and pain points. Add these gems to your trusty database for easy access later.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Have a couple of outbound sales email templates ready, but use the intel to edit them and speak to each leadâ€™s specific challenges. Provide tailored solutions based on what youâ€™ve learned.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"This shows you truly get them and have their back. Personal outreach brings meaning to your service and gets conversations started.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Effective outbound isnâ€™t just about immediate deals. Itâ€™s about providing real value on topics prospects care about to build trust and loyalty over the long haul.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"When crafting outreach, precision is key. Here are some tips:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Keep it concise and scannable. Get to the value fast in case theyâ€™re busy. Use bullets!","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Include personal details like names, companies, and roles to show you customized your email. Studies prove personalization improves open and response rates. An Experian study showed personalized emails have a ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/boost-your-open-rates-personalized-emails-key-successful-lisa-du-/"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"29% open rate","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" compared to an 18% open rate for non-personalized emails. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Highlight unique value by addressing their exact pain points and goals upfront. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Offer a clear CTA so they know the next step, whether booking a meeting, getting a demo, or subscribing to content. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"\nThe right balance of personalization and concise value is outbound magic. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Oh, and donâ€™t worry if you donâ€™t have the time or experience to do this yourself. Nowadays, you can use ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.artisan.co/talk-to-sales"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"AI Artisan Sales Reps","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" to handle everything on your behalf. Ava is trained to craft highly bespoke emails on behalf of your team. This gives you quality results without having to take up too much time. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Step #4 â€“ Undertaking Outbound Sales Calls, Demos, and Meetings","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Alright, your personalized outreach is getting results â€“ prospects are responding and ready to chat. Now itâ€™s time to guide them through the sales journey with calls, demos, and meetings.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"But hereâ€™s the key mindset shift: ditch the pitch and have an engaging conversation instead. Make it a two-way street!","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Listen closely to understand each prospect. A mere ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://blog.thebrevetgroup.com/21-mind-blowing-sales-stats"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"13% of customers","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" believe sales reps can understand their needs. If you can be the sales rep who cares, youâ€™re going to stand out from the bunch. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"A personalized, thoughtful approach allows you to refine your offer so it stays tailored to the customer. The goal isnâ€™t to pressure prospects into buying. Itâ€™s to build real connections through helpful education and valuable insights. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"When you take the time to engage prospects, you build trust and show how your solutions can help them. This thoughtful approach nurtures fruitful long-term relationships.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"So toss out the hard sell tactics. Successful outbound means focusing on the customer â€“ listening first, understanding fully, and guiding gently toward solutions that are the right fit.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Itâ€™s all about that human connection. Build rapport, provide value, and the deals will happen naturally. Outbound is so much more effective when it comes from the heart.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Booking calls and meetings can be time-consuming, but ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.artisan.co/talk-to-sales"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Artisan AI Sales Reps","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" can book meetings into your calendar at scale. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Pro tip","marks":[{"type":"italic"},{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":": Use call recording and transcription tools to analyze sales calls and pinpoint areas where you can improve.","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Step #5 â€“ Sealing the Deal","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"After your personalized outreach, tailored conversations, and meticulous follow-ups, the prospect is ready to become a customer.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The big moment is here, and itâ€™s time to seal the deal!","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Remember, your mission now is to problem-solve. If the prospect has any lingering concerns, itâ€™s your job to alleviate them. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Youâ€™ve put in the work to understand this prospect deeply. Now you need to guide them over the finish line, providing reassurance along the way.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Your persistence and consultative approach demonstrates that youâ€™re committed to their success. When you keep their needs at the center, deals close themselves!","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Here are some tips for effectively closing deals:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Be confident yet flexible in your approach","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Understand the prospectâ€™s decision-making process and adapt accordingly","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Emphasize the concrete benefits and ROI of your product or service","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Have pricing knowledge and be prepared to negotiate if needed","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Follow up regularly but avoid being too pushy","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"\nOr just let your trained, experienced AI reps do it for you.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Step #6 â€“ Continuously Refine Your Outbound Sales Process","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Outbound sales are always evolving, so youâ€™ve got to keep improving your approach. This means taking the time to stay on top of data, customer feedback, and industry trends.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Ways to step up your outbound game:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Build that pipeline! Prospect regularly and follow up with leads. Nurture it like a garden.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Make your messaging compelling and unique to each prospect. Get personal with it!","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Use tools like email automation, social media, and CRM to streamline things. Embrace the tech!","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Keep pace with industry changes and trends. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Analyze results to find areas to boost. Let the data guide you.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"\nImplementing these tips will enhance your current process and keep you ahead of the curve.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Feel empowered and confident to test new approaches and adapt. Never forget your goal is to provide value and forge lasting relationships.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Outbound excellence doesnâ€™t happen overnight, but by optimizing relentlessly, youâ€™ll get there!","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-2","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"5 Impressive Sales Practices to Improve Your Outbound Efforts","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"embedded-asset-block","data":{"target":{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"kyprwggh4muz"}},"id":"9fknYoWuwaEUeBJUFevZx","type":"Asset","createdAt":"2024-05-31T07:16:50.278Z","updatedAt":"2024-08-06T21:08:05.577Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":9,"revision":2,"locale":"en-US"},"fields":{"title":"23","description":"An infographic depicting 5 practices to improve outbound efforts: Be customer centric, Use social media, Streamline communications, Set Goals & track progress, and Use tools & automation.  ","file":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/kyprwggh4muz/9fknYoWuwaEUeBJUFevZx/5bbbc341d9cf91b10a1f82579ca5823b/23.png","details":{"size":378030,"image":{"width":1600,"height":772}},"fileName":"23.png","contentType":"image/png"}}}},"content":[]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Be Customer Centric","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"In a modern market, catering to customer experience is more important than ever. Customer-centric companies are ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://blog.hubspot.com/service/customer-experience-trends"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"60% more profitable","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":". Putting customers first should be your north star â€“ guide all efforts by it, especially above quotas! ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"A customer-centric approach means conducting thorough research to craft messaging that resonates deeply with each person. This demonstrates you truly understand their pain points and are committed to helping. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"When you lead with empathy and service, you build incredible trust and loyalty.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Remember â€“ prospects want to be seen, heard, and helped. Not targeted, pitched, and pressured. Keep the focus on making their lives easier and helping them reach their goals.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Customer-centricity is a mindset that shapes your whole approach. From initial outreach to closing the deal, always listen more than you speak. Seek to understand first, then to be understood.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Help first, sell second.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Leverage Social Media","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Social media is a major outbound sales hack. In fact, according to Hubspotâ€™s ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://blog.hubspot.com/sales/social-selling-stats"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"2023 Social Strategy Trends Report","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":", social media ranks third among the most effective sales channels. You can use LinkedIn, Twitter, and Instagram to connect with leads and build relationships like never before.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"There are plenty of ways to do this, from sharing valuable content to engaging your audience, and showing your thought leadership.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The more value you provide, the more authority you have and the more leads youâ€™ll attract.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"However, the key is balance. Again, be helpful and insightful rather than salesy. Provide value without always pushing your product. Social media is about making connections through engaging content. Think long-form LinkedIn posts commenting on industry trends. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"With time and effort, you can turn casual networking into meaningful conversations that convert leads.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Just keep it authentic.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Streamline Communications, Messages, and Scripts","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Having streamlined templates and scripts is crucial to ensuring consistent, effective messaging. It also allows easier training of new team members and saves time long-term.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"But donâ€™t just set it and forget it! Regularly optimize materials to improve clarity, relevance, and results. A/B test different versions. Update based on feedback. Tailor to new buyer personas. Add fresh examples and success stories.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Refined communications, messages, and scripts will take your outreach efforts to the next level. Put in the work upfront so each touchpoint moves smoothly forward.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Set Clear Goals and Track Progress","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Defining specific outbound sales goals is step one. Break each goal down into measurable metrics you can track daily, weekly, and monthly. Monitor key numbers like contact rate, prospect meetings set, deals closed, revenue generated.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Tracking progress gives you critical data to make smart improvements. Identify whatâ€™s working and double down on that. Find whatâ€™s not and switch up your approach.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Adjust your goals as needed and set reminders to analyze metrics regularly so you stay motivated and on track.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Outbound excellence is a marathon, not a sprint. With a clear roadmap and measurement system, you can achieve remarkable results.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Use Tools and Automation","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Technology has changed the outbound sales game! ","marks":[],"data":{}},